lta[a1][b0]*delta[b1][g0] + delta[a1][b1]*delta[b0][g0] + delta[a1][g0]*delta[b0][b1]) + delta[a0][g0]*(delta[a1][b0]*delta[b1][c0] + delta[a1][b1]*delta[b0][c0] + delta[a1][c0]*delta[b0][b1])))

